              <span>Is root canal treatment painful?</span>
              <svg class="faq-chevron w-5 h-5 text-[#C1121F] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div id="home-faq-1" class="px-5 pb-5 text-base text-slate-600">
