              <svg class="faq-chevron w-5 h-5 text-[#C1121F] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div id="home-faq-4" class="hidden px-5 pb-5 text-base text-slate-600">
              Yes. After checking how deep the marks are, Dr. Shubham Gupta will suggest safe options such as polishing, tooth-coloured bonding, or veneers to improve the shade evenly.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
            <button type="button" class="faq-trigger w-full min-h-[56px] px-5 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-[#1F2A30]" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="home-faq-5">
              <span>Do you treat children?</span>
              <svg class="faq-chevron w-5 h-5 text-[#C1121F] shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"/></svg>
